1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Bengta Nilsdotter Hästhuvud=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Nils Ottesson Hästhuvud to Holm and Agneta Matsdotter Körning
2 CONT * According to information online, Benkta died on September 5, 1636?? in Aspeboda . But I have not found her  in the death register/church accounts. But Benkta was probably still alive in 1642, considering that she is mentioned in
2 CONC  the court book for Tuna parish on June 3, 1642 , and not as "blessed", that is, deceased.
2 CONT * The inheritance was from her father Nils Ottesson's second marriage between her and her half-siblings on father Nils' side. Her half-siblings should have been those that Nils had with his wife Agneta Körning. "Asbo" is the old n
2 CONC ame for Aspeboda.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Married Albrecth Hansson in Aspeboda parish''' appears in a county register at Tuna parish on 3 June 1642 in Kopparberg County. The case concerned an inheritance that had been made on Benkta's part on 11 August 1636 .
2 CONT
