2 CONT Per Hansson , knighted Svinhufvud to Främby and Surarve. Be mine foreman at Salberget 1569. Got pp., On. 28/2 fief three homesteads in Torsång and Kopparberg parishes, which the fallen King Gustav I of sakfall after his mother's f
2 CONC ather, and wrote themselves unto Holm in Tuna parish, Kopparberg. Bailiff in the Baltic and the North-dales 1570-1574 and in Western Silvbergs County in 1574 2 . Got maintenance letter 2 1572-08-19. Knighted 1574-06-22. Each distr
2 CONC ict judge in Jönåkers District Texas in 1577 3 and wrote themselves unto Almby 3 in Jäders parish, Texas (swear father's property). Death before 1579 2 . His weapon was erected in the church Vansö 4 Texas. Married to Agneta Drivin
2 CONC g to Märinge in Strängnäs' landsförsaml. (on Tosteron) in her second married (married 1: o 1557-06-15 [Dower] on Almby with squire and bailiff of Korsholm and Ostrobothnia Nils Ottosson, the old horse head genera, to Holm Årby, in
2 CONC  his second married [married 1: o 1542-02-20 when he gave Holm in Dower, Anna Pers, daughter of Per Larsson (Ulfstand), to Årby Hall and ectopic, and HH Elin]). She was still alive in 1608, the daughter of knekthövidsmannen Matts 
2 CONC Driving and Beata Kuse.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Carl Persson . Assessor. Died 1634. See Tab. 2nd
2 CONT
2 CONT Jöns Persson . Bailiff. Died 1636. See Tab. 4th
2 CONT
2 CONT Lars Persson . Was present at the succession of Tammisaari 1604-04-12 after her aunt Mrs. Ingela Driving. [ 5 ]
2 CONT
2 CONT Erik Persson . Where present at said succession. [ 5 ]
2 CONT
