2 CONC exnder and Johanna Charlotta married and the place where she propably wee rasied. Johanna Charlottas mother and stepfather lived in Kjulö/Köyliö from at least year 1718. Her stepfather Johan Norberg  was captain. Johanna married A
2 CONC lexander in Kjulö  4/7 1736 . Soon there after she gave birth to a babydaughter -  f  Eva Charlotta, born in Harjavalta (15.7.1736 but died 17/7 1736))
